### **4. Зависимости через интерфейсы**

```php
// Application layer
interface LoanApplicationRepositoryInterface { /* ... */ }

// Infrastructure layer
class DoctrineLoanApplicationRepository implements LoanApplicationRepositoryInterface { /* ... */ }

// Injection в use case
