---

### **3. Rollback транзакций**

```php
abstract class RollbackTestCase extends TestCase
{
    protected function setUp(): void
    {
        $em = $this->getEntityManager();
        $em->beginTransaction();
    }

    protected function tearDown(): void
    {
        $em = $this->getEntityManager();
        $em->rollback();
    }
}
```

